  "details": "The good old CS1.6 had a feature called MOTD(message of the day) that loaded a text file(or html) and did show it to any new player in the map. It would be nice to have such a feature on the VRC_World prefab. I have a new input field in mind where you drop the text file asset in, the player would then see it after spawn and could click it away with a button or we can set a timer from 5 to 60 seconds to force the player to look at it. Would be nice for rules and/or information about the maps activities.\n\nedit: I think a web resource woud enable us to update it without the need to upload the entire world again. ;-)",
